[NAME]
sshnp \- NoPorts SSH client
[EXAMPLES]
.nf
sshnp -f @alice_client -t @alice_device -d my_server
sshnp -f @alice_client -t @alice_device -d my_server -r @rv_am -i ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
.fi
[SEE ALSO]
sshnpd(1), npt(1), srv(1), srvd(1), at_activate(1)
.PP
Full documentation at <https://docs.noports.com/>
